WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
ready to make gardening a little easier?

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.120
In this first section of our Perennial guide,

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:09.520
we'll introduce you to My Garden, your personal garden planning hub,

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:14.380
and provide a sneak peek at our free gardening app tools to help you plan,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.200
grow, and make the most of your gardening experience.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:22.040
If you ever get lost and need a little extra guidance with our website or web app,

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.220
just visit our help section located in the main menu.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:28.860
You'll find step-by-step guides, helpful demonstrations,

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:34.400
and practical resources designed to walk you through each garden app at your own pace.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:35.720
Let's get started!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.920
Whether you're planting your very first seed or planting something bigger,

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:45.320
we're here to help you grow with confidence, and it all starts with My Garden.

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:51.040
Just select the green open My Garden button to discover your personal garden planning workspace.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.600
Not sure where to begin?

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:58.320
That's okay. Start with My Growing Zone to understand what grows best in your climate.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:02.700
Next, explore Map Garden Space to envision your growing area,

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:06.240
and use the Seasonal Calendar to learn when it's time to plant.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:09.780
Discover which plants grow well together with Plant Companions.

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:14.800
Then, use the Garden Calculator to help plan your materials and growing needs.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.600
Wondering what's growing in your garden or what's causing a problem?

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.100
Explore our plant, pest, and disease identifier.

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:27.380
As your garden grows, keep track of your experiences with garden journal and logs,

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:30.860
and celebrate your progress with harvest and garden records.

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:32.660
And that's just the beginning!

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.660
There's even more to explore!

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.360
You don't have to do everything at once.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:42.600
Start with one tool, learn something new, and take the next step when you're ready.

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:44.520
Perennial home and gardens.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.520
Plan it. Grow it. Live it.

